    "m2_prompt_trader_proposal_original": "**Action**: Hold\n\n**Reasoning**: The investment plan presents a genuinely balanced case for AMZN. The bullish technical structure (price above all rising moving averages, RSI at 61.90, compressing ATR) supports maintaining exposure, but the bearish momentum divergences (24-day negative MACD histogram, RSI lower highs, deceleration from +20% to +2% to +1.25%) and the complete absence of news/sentiment/macro confirmation argue against adding new full-size exposure at the 60-day peak. The risk-reward at $180.38 (8-11% upside to $195-200 vs. 5.5-19.3% downside to the 50/200 SMA) is not compelling for fresh entries, but the intact trend structure does not justify selling for existing holders. A HOLD with tightened risk management is the appropriate action.\n\n**Entry Price**: 180.38\n\n**Stop Loss**: 178.35\n\n**Position Sizing**: Maintain moderate weight; do not add new full-size exposure at current levels. Consider adding on pullback to $170-172 zone or on confirmed breakout above $182 with volume and news confirmation.\n\nFINAL TRANSACTION PROPOSAL: **HOLD**",
